Attribution notes (classic mechanics; original code in this folder):

- merge2048 — gameplay concept popularized by Gabriele Cirulli's 2048
  (MIT License, https://github.com/gabrielecirulli/2048). This folder ships an
  independent mobile-first implementation, not a copy of Cirulli's sources.
- snake / breakout / puzzle15 / hop — classic public-domain game mechanics;
  original HTML5 Canvas/DOM implementations written for PAIDIA Kids.
